{"id":"c98bc9b1a979b2fd","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-sequence-concatenation.md","title":"Finite Sequence and Coded Concatenation","display":"df-sequence-concatenation — Finite Sequence and Coded Concatenation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-sequence-concatenation","aliases":["57-df-sequence-concatenation"],"display":"df-sequence-concatenation — Finite Sequence and Coded Concatenation","depends_on":["[[57-df-encoding]]","[[57-df-primitive-recursive]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-sequence-concatenation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-sequence-concatenation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sequence-concatenation — Finite Sequence and Coded Concatenation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b2e96ed477b7b031\" href=\"?note=b2e96ed477b7b031\" title=\"57-df-encoding\">57-df-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6198f000bea16af4\" href=\"?note=6198f000bea16af4\" title=\"57-df-primitive-recursive\">57-df-primitive-recursive</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 为集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in X^m,t\\in X^n,a\\in X\">\\(s\\in X^m,t\\in X^n,a\\in X\\)</span>，列按零起始索引。数码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u,v,b\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(u,v,b\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{scode},\\operatorname{sdecode}\">\\(\\operatorname{scode},\\operatorname{sdecode}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b2e96ed477b7b031\" href=\"?note=b2e96ed477b7b031\" title=\"57-df-encoding\">57-df-encoding</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PR}_2\">\\(\\mathrm{PR}_2\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6198f000bea16af4\" href=\"?note=6198f000bea16af4\" title=\"57-df-primitive-recursive\">57-df-primitive-recursive</a>。一般论域上的列与其自然数码是不同类型。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m,n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s(i)\">\\(s(i)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t(j)\">\\(t(j)\\)</span> 分别是相应有限列在有效索引处的函数值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s\\frown t\\coloneqq\\{\\langle i,s(i)\\rangle:i&lt;m\\}\\cup\\{\\langle m+j,t(j)\\rangle:j&lt;n\\},\\qquad\ns\\dashv a\\coloneqq s\\frown\\langle a\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s\\frown t\\coloneqq\\{\\langle i,s(i)\\rangle:i&lt;m\\}\\cup\\{\\langle m+j,t(j)\\rangle:j&lt;n\\},\\qquad\ns\\dashv a\\coloneqq s\\frown\\langle a\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{concat}(u,v)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{scode}(\\operatorname{sdecode}(u)\\frown\\operatorname{sdecode}(v)),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{append}(u,b)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{scode}(\\operatorname{sdecode}(u)\\frown\\langle b\\rangle).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{concat}(u,v)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{scode}(\\operatorname{sdecode}(u)\\frown\\operatorname{sdecode}(v)),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{append}(u,b)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{scode}(\\operatorname{sdecode}(u)\\frown\\langle b\\rangle).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"u\\mathbin{\\frown}b\\coloneqq\\operatorname{append}(u,b)\\quad(u,b\\in\\mathbb N),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{concat},\\operatorname{append}\\in\\mathrm{PR}_2.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[u\\mathbin{\\frown}b\\coloneqq\\operatorname{append}(u,b)\\quad(u,b\\in\\mathbb N),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{concat},\\operatorname{append}\\in\\mathrm{PR}_2.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有类型的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\frown t\">\\(s\\frown t\\)</span> 是列连接；数值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\frown b\">\\(u\\frown b\\)</span> 是向编码列追加一个自然数。EF 游戏只使用前者，不把任意载体元素当成自然数码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"b2e96ed477b7b031","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"6198f000bea16af4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-primitive-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"b2e96ed477b7b031","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X$ 为集合，$s\\in X^m,t\\in X^n,a\\in X$，列按零起始索引。数码 $u,v,b\\in\\mathbb N$ 及 $\\operatorname{scode},\\operatorname{sdecode}$ 取 [[57-df-encoding]]；$\\mathrm{PR}_2$ 取 [[57-df-primitive-recursive]]。一般论域上的列与其自然数码是不同类型。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"6198f000bea16af4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X$ 为集合，$s\\in X^m,t\\in X^n,a\\in X$，列按零起始索引。数码 $u,v,b\\in\\mathbb N$ 及 $\\operatorname{scode},\\operatorname{sdecode}$ 取 [[57-df-encoding]]；$\\mathrm{PR}_2$ 取 [[57-df-primitive-recursive]]。一般论域上的列与其自然数码是不同类型。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in X^m,t\\in X^n,a\\in X","display":false},{"tex":"u,v,b\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{scode},\\operatorname{sdecode}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PR}_2","display":false},{"tex":"m,n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"s(i)","display":false},{"tex":"t(j)","display":false},{"tex":"s\\frown t\\coloneqq\\{\\langle i,s(i)\\rangle:i<m\\}\\cup\\{\\langle m+j,t(j)\\rangle:j<n\\},\\qquad\ns\\dashv a\\coloneqq s\\frown\\langle a\\rangle.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{concat}(u,v)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{scode}(\\operatorname{sdecode}(u)\\frown\\operatorname{sdecode}(v)),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{append}(u,b)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{scode}(\\operatorname{sdecode}(u)\\frown\\langle b\\rangle).","display":true},{"tex":"u\\mathbin{\\frown}b\\coloneqq\\operatorname{append}(u,b)\\quad(u,b\\in\\mathbb N),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{concat},\\operatorname{append}\\in\\mathrm{PR}_2.","display":true},{"tex":"s\\frown t","display":false},{"tex":"u\\frown b","display":false}],"bytes":1477,"backlinks":[{"id":"40a9587a80026ff4","anchor":"ref-17","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\frown\\langle a\\rangle$ 是在数学列末尾附加一个元素，$\\equiv_n$ 见 [[57-df-n-equivalence]]。[[57-df-sequence-concatenation]] 的操作作用于数码，本文件不直接将任意论域元素传给该数码函数。"},{"id":"672b43fc6a891c3a","anchor":"ref-54","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[57-df-sequence-concatenation]]"},{"id":"ca4dd8b012648fba","anchor":"ref-232","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-addition-function]]\n[[57-df-composition-operator]]\n[[57-df-divrem-function]]\n[[57-df-effective-procedure]]\n[[57-df-encoding]]\n[[57-df-factorial-function]]\n[[57-df-function-closure]]\n[[57-df-halt-notation]]\n[[57-df-machine-coding]]\n[[57-df-min-operator-generalized]]\n[[57-df-multiplication-function]]\n[[57-df-normal-form-theorem]]\n[[57-df-primrec-operator]]\n[[57-df-program-numbering]]\n[[57-df-projection-function]]\n[[57-df-recursive-function-class]]\n[[57-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate]]\n[[57-df-sequence-concatenation]]\n[[57-df-successor-function]]\n[[57-df-t-predicate]]\n[[57-df-turing-machine]]\n[[57-df-zero-function]]"}],"outgoing":["b2e96ed477b7b031","6198f000bea16af4"]}